# Stage 5 golden tour (M4, D-036 style): the real game from the title with
# the run started at St. Wolfgang (`level = st_wolfgang`, D-047): START at
# frame 21, stage intro 21..170, then the inputs of st_wolfgang_solver.replay
# unchanged from frame 171 (re-copy them after `cargo xtask solve
# st_wolfgang --write`; the xtask tour coupling test checks it), then 800
# idle frames: the Maibaum sequence, the tally, the route map to the
# Wolfgangsee, which has no level yet, so the teaser („Fortsetzung folgt …",
# with St. Wolfgang's raised label, D-072) and the title, with the run reset
# to its first stage (here St. Wolfgang). The solver route rides the train
# a little, runs ahead along the rock steps under the track, catches the
# train again at the gorge and leaps from its roof to the shelf under the
# halt (the accepted D-067 shortcut; st_wolfgang_zug rides the whole way).
